    "impact": "The GI tag has helped preserve the authenticity of Jaunpur Imarti and improved recognition for genuine products. It is the first product from Jaunpur to receive GI status, which is expected to boost its popularity and market value. The postal department has released a special cover on Jaunpur Imarti, which will lead to its global branding and wide publicity."
